(386,813,'An acute, highly infectious disease caused by a bacillus (Salmonella typhi) transmitted chiefly by contaminated food or water and characterized by high fever, headache, coughing, intestinal hemorrhaging, and rose-colored spots on the skin.','en',2,'2026-05-29 23:29:31',NULL,NULL,'140FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
